{"articleNo":"101934","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=101934&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"생활관생 가족 식사체험 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.02.28","hit":"3799","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014학년도 1학기 입사기간동안 생활관을 방문하시는 생활관생 가족분들에게 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">생활관의 편의시설 관람과 식사를 제공하고자 합니다.</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 기 간 : 2014. 3. 1.~ 3. 2.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [기간 중 체력단련실 및 휴게실 개방]</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 식사제공 </span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt